{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MARVEL Puzzle Quest is the <strong>ultimate Match 3 Super Hero RPG experience!</strong> Collect and level up your favorite characters to discover incredible strategic depth like no other Match-3 has to offer! Become a puzzle combat master as you learn to harness superpowers to bend the gem board to your will. Start your journey to defeat super-powerful cosmic threats to save the universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join over <strong>40 million players</strong> in deep strategic puzzle combat. Recruit <strong>375+ Super Heroes and Super Villains</strong> from across the Marvel Universe, master unique superpowers, and harness t<strong>he ultimate power of the new 6-Star tier!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT </strong>+ UNLOCK YOUR FAVORITE MARVEL HEROES - Complete your comic collection and forge an unstoppable team</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE </strong>+ MAXIMIZE YOUR TEAM'S POWER - Continuously level up your roster to take on bigger challenges</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT </strong>IN A TACTICAL MATCH-3 BATTLEFIELD\u00a0- Every move is a tactical decision in this action packed match-3 combat system.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER </strong>HEAD-TO-HEAD PVP + ENDLESS CHALLENGES\u00a0- Take part in constant, high-stakes events throughout the year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble your legendary Super Hero roster</strong> and master the gem board! Harness <strong>iconic Marvel powers</strong> and outwit foes in engaging, tactical, puzzle combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/3b37231c1f676717426eb4f6e6a53882.webp?t=1774536312\" width=800 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT + UNLOCK YOUR FAVORITE MARVEL HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/02e9f030c4ec6bc3692029dcbfb84f4d.poster.avif?t=1774536312\" width=780 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/02e9f030c4ec6bc3692029dcbfb84f4d.webm?t=1774536312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your comic collection and forge an unstoppable team with characters and artwork pulled directly from Marvel Comics history.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit 375+ Heroes:</strong> Collect original Marvel Comic Covers to instantly unlock and recruit icons like Spider-Man, Captain America, and Doctor Doom.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Ultimate Roster:</strong> Collect heroes and villains from across the Marvel Universe, from street-level Wolverine to the cosmic threat of Thanos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/3b37231c1f676717426eb4f6e6a53882.webp?t=1774536312\" width=800 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE + MAXIMIZE YOUR TEAM'S POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/3865285b09a68ac73f864ab40e49d661.poster.avif?t=1774536312\" width=780 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/3865285b09a68ac73f864ab40e49d661.webm?t=1774536312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously level up your roster to take on bigger challenges.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Your Heroes Stronger:</strong> Use collected <strong>Covers</strong> to level up and improve your favorite characters. Every new Cover you add increases their unique Powers, turning a starting hero into a true powerhouse!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Strategy:</strong> Focus on the strategic pairing of heroes and chase Covers for the latest and rarest <strong>5-Star</strong> characters and beyond. Unlock their full potential and dominate your opponents across the game's many modes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/3b37231c1f676717426eb4f6e6a53882.webp?t=1774536312\" width=800 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT IN A TACTICAL MATCH-3 BATTLEFIELD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/d6b878ab19a985c3c3ce07454edc8732.poster.avif?t=1774536312\" width=780 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/d6b878ab19a985c3c3ce07454edc8732.webm?t=1774536312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The board is your battlefield. Every move is a tactical decision in this action packed match-3 combat system.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Superpowers:</strong> Match 3 or more gems to generate<strong> Attack Power</strong> and fuel your hero\u2019s unique abilities. Deploy powerful skills to deal massive damage or manipulate the board in your favor.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth:</strong> This is far beyond simple matching. Master team synergies and tactical planning to secure victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/3b37231c1f676717426eb4f6e6a53882.webp?t=1774536312\" width=800 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER HEAD-TO-HEAD PVP &amp; ENDLESS CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/2bf206c433306b4df9f269d7ac284fb9.poster.avif?t=1774536312\" width=780 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/2bf206c433306b4df9f269d7ac284fb9.webm?t=1774536312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your newly assembled Marvel dream team and prove their strength by taking part in constant, high-stakes events throughout the year.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the Leaderboards:</strong> Battle friends and rivals in seasonal tournaments. Dominate in the newly re-scaled S.H.I.E.L.D. Clearance Levels (SCL), with competitive top tiers designed to test even the strongest teams.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Content Daily:</strong> Take on \u2018<i>Deadpool\u2019s Daily Challenge\u2019 </i>and many other limited-time story events for epic rewards. New characters, costumes, and major updates are added <strong>constantly</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/3b37231c1f676717426eb4f6e6a53882.webp?t=1774536312\" width=800 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START YOUR MARVEL MATCH-3 RPG ADVENTURE TODAY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/2434b9dbcfabca87b98e2394800c7d3c.poster.avif?t=1774536312\" width=780 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/extras/2434b9dbcfabca87b98e2394800c7d3c.webm?t=1774536312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no time to waste\u2014<strong>install now</strong> to unleash your inner super hero and save the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/234330?t=1774536312","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/dad51c89310ed6637016ac0740b131a421ab18ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774536312","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/c36aa1a2d8cd9c7a12a089dfbd19a0121bc96a2c/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_6.jpg?t=1774536312","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/234330/c36aa1a2d8cd9c7a12a089dfbd19a0121bc96a2c/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_6.jpg?t=1774536312","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","